# Cloudflare Pages: clean URLs like /the-yummy-place/ serve the shared
# template. Static files (style.css, app.js, /cafes/**) still resolve
# directly — Pages serves existing assets before applying this rewrite.
# New cafes need NO changes here; the splat covers every folder name.
# Files a page asks for relative to /<slug>/ → serve the real ones
/:slug/style.css   /style.css      200
/:slug/app.js      /app.js         200
/:slug/cafes/*     /cafes/:splat   200
/*    /index.html   200
